     "text": "CPU Memory Hierarchy\n\nEnd-to-End Load/Store Path: Address Resolution – TLB – Cache\nHierarchy – DRAM\n\n\n\n\n\n A TLB miss requires address translation work. A cache miss determines whether\n▪\n  the data must come from a lower level.\n  Only a miss through the cache hierarchy sends the data request to the memory\n▪\n  controller and DRAM.\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory    GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        30",
